    "original_source_sha256": "6c5293cd178066394add306a44a96c17ae58c1d5440d4d0eedd18eb5dda0b09d",
    "modified": "Retained the licensed source plinth, its UVs and materials with uniform meter scaling. Replaced the original 82-triangle untapered, undersized shaft and its fictional open chamber with a closed 14-triangle tapered obelisk: 16.8021m base side, 10.5029m pyramid-base side at Z=152.4m, apex Z=169.294175m. Recalculated outward flat normals and mapped the replacement to a clean limestone patch of the original Monument atlas. Small observation windows are omitted. Shaft and plinth share Z=0 at the lowest plinth point; the plinth overlaps the lowest shaft and adds no extra height. The 500ft junction is an NPS stated level, not a sub-inch survey value.",
    "dimensions_source": "https://www.nps.gov/wamo/learn/historyculture/index.htm",
